@ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5105
@ApiKey = dev-api-key-change-me

### Health
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Список залів
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/halls
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Пошук доступних
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/halls/available?start=2024-09-01T10:00:00&end=2024-09-01T14:00:00&requiredCapacity=50
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Створити зал
POST {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/halls
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Зал D",
  "capacity": 40,
  "baseHourlyRate": 1800,
  "services": [
    { "name": "Проєктор", "price": 500 },
    { "name": "Wi-Fi", "price": 300 }
  ]
}

### Оновити зал (підставте ID)
PUT {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/halls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Зал А",
  "capacity": 55,
  "baseHourlyRate": 2500,
  "services": [
    { "name": "Проєктор", "price": 500 },
    { "name": "Wi-Fi", "price": 300 },
    { "name": "Звук", "price": 700 }
  ]
}

### Видалити зал
DELETE {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/halls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Бронювання
POST {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hallId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "start": "2024-09-02T10:00:00",
  "end": "2024-09-02T14:00:00",
  "selectedServices": [ "Проєктор", "Wi-Fi" ],
  "customerName": "ТОВ Приклад"
}

### Звіти
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/summary
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/revenue-by-hall
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/occupancy
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###
GET {{ConferenceHallBooking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reports/popular-services
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
